mods/space-groups/sidebar.js and mods/space-groups/menu.js are adapted from the
`spaces` and `menu` mods shipped with the Herdr app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE). They were changed to add space groups: group
sections in the sidebar, dragging spaces between groups, the group items in the
space menu, the group menu, reordering groups, and the shared `space-groups.menu`
items.

mods/space-groups-agents/main.js is adapted from the `agents` mod shipped with the
Herdr app, under the same license. It was changed to add the "Grouped by folder"
sort, which groups agents under the space groups.

mods/space-groups/arrow-up.svg and mods/space-groups/arrow-down.svg are Lucide
icons (https://lucide.dev), licensed under the ISC License,
Copyright (c) Lucide Contributors.

.github/hero/scene is a scene for Stageshow
(https://github.com/benjitaylor/skills), which .github/hero/render.mjs
downloads to render .github/hero/space-groups.gif. Stageshow is licensed under
the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Benji Taylor. The GIF shows Stageshow's
cursors and Lucide icons.

